**Delivered** (`apps/apple/TeslaSync/shared-surfaces/MaintenanceBanner.*`):
- **Adapter** (pure core): service-mode enum, dismissal **fingerprint** (web `fingerprint`), `formatRemaining`, countdown boundary ladder (`>1000 / >-1000 / else`), RFC3339 parser (web `Date.parse`), title/body (`message.trim() || default`), VoiceOver label.
